---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Your Name Glass — Residential Window & Glass Replacement"
description: "Residential glass replacement for windows, sliding doors, shower enclosures, and mirrors. Serving Central Florida. Licensed & insured. Call (407) 555-0190."
---

  <!-- HERO: full-bleed background with dark overlay box left -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-bg"></div>
    <div class="hero-content">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="hero-box">
          <span class="hero-eyebrow">Residential Glass Specialists</span>
          <h1>Clear Glass.<br>Clear Prices.</h1>
          <div class="hero-rule"></div>
          <p>Windows, sliding doors, shower enclosures, and mirrors — replaced right, on time, at a fair price.</p>
          <div class="hero-actions">
            <a href="tel:{{ site.phoneHref }}" class="btn btn--gold btn--lg">Call {{ site.phone }}</a>
            <a href="{{ '/contact/' | url }}" class="btn btn--outline-white btn--lg">Free Estimate</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- TRUST STRIP -->
  <div class="trust-strip">
    <div class="container trust-inner">
      <div class="trust-item">
        <strong>{{ site.yearsExp }}+ Years</strong>
        <span>in the glass trade</span>
      </div>
      <div class="trust-item">
        <strong>Residential Only</strong>
        <span>we know your home</span>
      </div>
      <div class="trust-item">
        <strong>Same-Week</strong>
        <span>scheduling available</span>
      </div>
      <div class="trust-item">
        <strong>Licensed &amp; Insured</strong>
        <span>proof provided on request</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- OUR SERVICES -->
  <section class="section section--light">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2>Our Services</h2>
        <div class="section-rule"></div>
        <p>We handle every type of residential glass — from a single broken pane to a custom shower enclosure. All work is measured on-site and cut to exact fit.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="service-grid">
        {%- for s in services.list %}
        <div class="service-card">
          <div class="service-photo">
            <img src="{{ ('/' + s.image) | url }}" alt="{{ s.name }}" loading="lazy">
          </div>
          <div class="service-card-body">
            <h3>{{ s.name }}</h3>
            <div class="card-rule"></div>
            <p>{{ s.tagline }}</p>
            <a href="{{ '/services/' | url }}#{{ s.slug }}" class="link-arrow">Learn more</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        {%- endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ABOUT US -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2>About Us</h2>
        <div class="section-rule"></div>
        <p>We're a family-owned residential glass company that has been serving Central Florida since {{ site.founded }}. Every job is measured in person, cut to your exact specs, and installed by our own crew.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="about-split">
        <div class="about-photo-wrap">
          <div class="about-photo-rect">
            <img src="{{ '/about-team.webp' | url }}" alt="{{ site.name }} team" loading="lazy">
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="about-features">
          <div class="about-feature">
            <div class="feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="28" height="28" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3>Licensed &amp; Insured</h3>
              <p>We carry full general liability and workers' compensation. Proof provided before any job — no exceptions, no excuses.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="about-feature">
            <div class="feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="28" height="28" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M2 12h20M12 2l10 10-10 10"/><line x1="2" y1="12" x2="22" y2="12"/><polyline points="16 6 22 12 16 18"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3>Measured On-Site, Every Time</h3>
              <p>We don't order glass from a description over the phone. Every job gets a precise in-person measurement so the glass fits right the first time.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="about-feature">
            <div class="feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="28" height="28" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3>Same-Week Scheduling</h3>
              <p>Most non-emergency jobs are scheduled within 2–4 business days. For broken or exposed glass, we make every effort to get there sooner.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- REVIEWS -->
  <section class="section section--light">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2>What Our Customers Say</h2>
        <div class="section-rule"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="review-grid">
        {%- for r in reviews.list | limit(3) %}
        <div class="review-card">
          <div class="review-stars" aria-label="{{ r.stars }} out of 5">{% for i in range(0, r.stars) %}★{% endfor %}</div>
          <p class="review-text">"{{ r.text }}"</p>
          <div class="review-byline">{{ r.name }} <span>— {{ r.city }}</span></div>
        </div>
        {%- endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SERVICE AREAS -->
  <section class="section section--slate">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head">
        <span class="eyebrow eyebrow--light">Where We Work</span>
        <h2>{{ site.areaServed }} &amp; Surrounding Communities</h2>
        <div class="section-rule section-rule--gold"></div>
        <p>We serve the communities we know — no long drives that get passed on to you as fuel charges.</p>
      </div>
      <ul class="neighborhood-list">
        {%- for a in areas.list %}
        <li>{{ a }}</li>
        {%- endfor %}
      </ul>
      <div class="center">
        <a href="{{ '/service-areas/' | url }}" class="link-arrow link-arrow--light">See full coverage area</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FAQ -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2>Questions We Hear a Lot</h2>
        <div class="section-rule"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-list">
        {%- for item in faq.list %}
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary class="faq-q"><span>{{ item.q }}</span><span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary>
          <p class="faq-a">{{ item.a }}</p>
        </details>
        {%- endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

{% include "partials/cta.njk" %}
